8, "end": 26.32}, {"text": "fijo,", "type": "word", "start": 26.4, "end": 26.96}, {"text": "por", "type": "word", "start": 27, "end": 27.04}, {"text": "ejemplo,", "type": "word", "start": 27.12, "end": 27.84}, {"text": "un", "type": "word", "start": 27.92, "end": 28}, {"text": "lavado", "type": "word", "start": 28.12, "end": 28.4}, {"text": "cada", "type": "word", "start": 28.56, "end": 28.8}, {"text": "semana.", "type": "word", "start": 28.88, "end": 29.36}, {"text": "Así", "type": "word", "start": 29.68, "end": 29.84}, {"text": "tienes", "type": "word", "start": 29.92, "end": 30.16}, {"text": "clientes", "type": "word", "start": 30.36, "end": 30.56}, {"text": "que", "type": "word", "start": 30.64, "end": 30.72}, {"text": "vuelven,", "type": "word", "start": 30.8, "end": 31.44}, {"text": "y", "type": "word", "start": 31.467, "end": 31.493}, {"text": "no", "type": "word", "start": 31.52, "end": 31.6}, {"text": "tienes", "type": "word", "start": 31.68, "end": 31.92}, {"text": "que", "type": "word", "start": 31.96, "end": 32}, {"text": "salir", "type": "word", "start": 32.08, "end": 32.32}, {"text": "a", "type": "word", "start": 32.36, "end": 32.4}, {"text": "buscar", "type": "word", "start": 32.6, "end": 32.8}, {"text": "todos", "type": "word", "start": 32.96, "end": 33.28}, {"text": "los", "type": "word", "start": 33.36, "end": 33.44}, {"text": "días.", "type": "word", "start": 33.52, "end": 34.16}], "text": "[energetic] Número diez: lavar carros y motos.\n\nSuena básico, pero funciona. Mucha gente del barrio no tiene tiempo para hacerlo, y prefiere pagarle a alguien de confianza.\n\nSolo necesitas un balde, jabón para carros, toallas de microfibra... y muchas ganas.\n\nEmpieza con los vecinos que ya te conocen, haz un trabajo impecable y pídeles que te recomienden.\n\nUn buen tip: ofrece un plan fijo, por ejemplo, un lavado cada semana. Así tienes clientes que vuelven, y no tienes que salir a buscar todos los días."}